 "note": "The small half of the pair Semir asked for on 2026-10-02: these three on the Creality, SOKOL enlarged on the A2L. Route is plain .gcode — straight to the SD card, no slicer. Same three bodies as specimens/2026-10-01_pure_weft_A1, regenerated for the Ender (bead 0.42, layer 0.20), so the layer programs differ: 120 / 100 / 150 layers against the A1’s 100 / 83 / 125. PUN_KOCKA first FAILED the gate with four LONG_BRIDGE up to 19.79 mm at z 23 on the first cap course; the material was fine and the gate was aliasing — a dense course typed ‘wall’ was LOD’d to ~2.5 mm vertices over a 4.71 mm pitch below, and support is decided at vertices. Fixed at the source: a fill is typed ‘bridge’ (vertices preserved) when THIS layer is sparse OR the layer below is. Guard: tests/pure_weft.test.mjs. Files marked inRepository:false are excluded for size per repository policy and listed by SHA-256; rebuild them with the two commands in README.md.",
